      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-11-24_WidnesExaminer_art0009" n="art0009">
        <head>ROSE'S FEMALE PILLS.</head>
        <p>ROSE'S FEMALE PILLS.</p>
        <p>Known all over the world as the safest and only certain remedy tor all nervous Headaches, Anemia, Irregularities, Periodic Troubles. and all Female Ailments. They quickly restore sufferers to regular health and remove those dis- tressing symptoms as prevalent with the sex.</p>
        <p>MEDICAL OFFICER'S OPINION. Dr. A. Farr, ox-Medical Officer of Health, reports: "This is to certify that Rose's Pills do not contain any deleterious properties, and may be taken with perfect safety by all females as a remedial agent and corrective for the vsrieuS ailments they are recommended fer." 2s. 9d. per case, Government Stamped, post free with full directions. Advice by letter free. Thousands of Testimonials from patients cured,</p>
        <p>ROSE &amp; CO., 21 ARTHUR-TERRACE DEPTFORD LOWER-ROAD, LONDON, B.E.</p>
        <p>DR. DR.ROOI3</p>
        <p>COMPOUND RENAL PILLS</p>
        <p>Are justly celebrated all over the world as the most safe and speedy remedy for Pains in the Back, Gravel. Lumbago, Gout, Rheumatism, Weakness across the Loins, Sandy or other Deposits. Stone In the Bladder, Discharges, and Diseases of the Kidneys and Urinary Organs generally. Many complaints, supposed io be nervous, often arise solely from contamination of the blood with certain impurities which should have been carried off by the kidneys. Every package bears the • Government stamp, with the WOl4lB. •• WALTER Da BOOS. LONDON," thereon, by order of Her. Majesty's Hon. Commissioners, Price Is. ltd. and 2s. 9d., at all Medicine Houses, or post free from Proprietors, Holtord House, Holford-square, Landon, W.C.</p>
        <p>For nearly 20 years</p>
        <p>DR. DAVIS'</p>
        <p>FAMOUS FEMALE PILLS</p>
        <p>have been universally admitted to he A BOON TO WOMANKIND. They are the best known remedy for Anomie, Giddiness Fulness and Swelling after Meals, Loss of Appetite, Hysteria, Palpitation of the Heart, Debility, Depression, Weakness, Irregularities and all Female Ailments. Boxes, 9id., Is. lid., 2s. 9d and 4s. 6d. May be had from Chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors everywhere. Do not be persuaded to accept a substitute. If not in stock ask them to obtain them, or to be had direct from the Pro- prietor— Dn. DAVIS, 309, Portobello-road, Notting Hill. London.</p>
        <p>W. B. SWEETMAN'S HAIR LOTION. The Best Remedy for FALLING OR WEAK HAIR, And Sure Preventative of Baldness. PRICE 2s. 6d. PER BOTTLE. 6, RANELAGH-STREET, LIVERPOOL (Opposite Central Station).</p>
        <p>BOWLS.</p>
        <p>BOWLS. BOWLING-GREEN BOWLS.</p>
        <p>JOSEPH DARLINGTON</p>
        <p>BOWLS</p>
        <p>the noted old owl Turner, invites the inspection of his good selection of Bowls made out of the best quality dark lignun. vitce, and made strictly to follow the jack.</p>
        <p>BILLIARD BALLS, &amp;c.</p>
        <p>GENERAL WOOD AND IVORY TURNER.</p>
        <p>19, 14, S.; 16, SLATER-SMEET, LIVERPOOL</p>
        <p>Established 1826.</p>
