        <p>At flanson-lane, before only a moderate att9ndance of spectators. This match was the only one ;:layed. the fog ransin. the others to be cancelle 1. On the teams entering the field, Halifax turned out as selected. Riga is not able to play yet owing to injory, Halifax have</p>
