      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-11-24_WidnesExaminer_art0113" n="art0113">
        <head>OLD FALSk. METH BOUGHT</head>
        <p>OLD FALSk. METH BOUGHT</p>
        <p>Many ladies and gentlemen have by them old or disufied false teeth, which might as well te turned into money. Messrs. 11. La.ec. J. B. Fraser, of Princess-street, Ipswich (established since 1884), buy old talse teeth. If you send you teeth to them they will remit you by return of post the utmost value ;or if preferred, they will make you the best offer, and hold the teeth over for your reply. If referencs necessary, apply to Messrs. Bacon t Co., Bankers Ipswich.—Advt</p>
